      "sentence": "However, the comment does not explicitly mention a specific section, table, figure, or unique aspect of the paper.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "评分标准第 5 档允许‘explicitly mentions which part of the paper it addresses, or it should be obvious to the authors’，评论明确指向 baselines（基线选择部分），对作者而言显而易见，CoT 却将‘显式提到章节/图表’作为必要条件，属于门槛误用。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, the comment is not explicitly grounded in a specific part of the paper, but it does identify the issue and the relevant model.",
      "error_type": "score_mapping_error",
      "explanation": "理由自身已承认评论指出了基线遗漏的具体问题（应加入 GNN-QE 并比较），且所指部分（baselines）显而易见，按标准应为 5 分，却映射到 3 分档（作者无法确定所指部分），与分数档位含义不符。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "待评价评论明确针对 baselines 部分并具体说明了缺失的 GNN-QE 基线及补救要求，符合 5 分标准；CoT 理由误用 grounding 门槛并错误映射分数，其证据支撑错误预测 3，属于有害推理。"
}
